e", "generation_batch": "feature_knowledge_seed_20260511T091258Z"}, "is_active": true}, {"id": "a55c493d-8874-552d-94d8-22805701e1db", "parent_slug": "event-promo-engine", "slug": "event-promo-claims", "name": "Event Promo Claims", "item_type": "sub_feature", "description": "", "sort_order": 202, "metadata": {"source_doc_type": "curated_sub_feature", "generation_batch": "feature_knowledge_seed_20260511T091258Z"}, "is_active": true}, {"id": "e872c7e0-c727-5e76-9621-5bd63635b3e0", "parent_slug": "forms", "slug": "default-fields", "name": "Default Fields", "item_type": "sub_feature", "description": "", "sort_order": 1301, "metadata": {"source_doc_type": "curated_sub_feature", "generation_batch": "feature_knowledge_seed_20260511T091258Z"}, "is_active": true}, {"id": "cf7c2b4c-ab9d-5440-95cf-02475002d58a", "parent_slug": "forms", "slug": "custom-fields", "name": "Custom Fields", "item_type": "sub_feature", "description": "", "sort_order": 1302, "metadata": {"source_doc_type": "curated_sub_feature", "generation_batch": "feature_knowledge_seed_20260511T091258Z"}, "is_active": true}, {"id": "94c5cc9a-5e1e-54e2-9301-673f74b966a2", "parent_slug": "forms", "slug": "pdpa-consent", "name": "PDPA Consent", "item_type": "sub_feature", "description": "", "sort_order": 1303, "metadata": {"source_doc_type": "curated_sub_feature", "generation_batch": "feature_knowledge_seed_20260511T091258Z"}, "is_active": true}, {"id": "973bac85-e011-5506-8158-0ce598036f35", "parent_slug": "loyalty", "slug": "activity-based-earning", "name": "Activity-Based Earning", "item_type": "feature", "description": "Activity-Based Earning is an image-upload-based earning mechanism where members submit proof photos of completed activities (exercise, POSM checks, volunteer work) and earn currency upon admin approval. Unlike purchase-based earning which processes transactions automatically, thi", "sort_order": 4, "metadata": {"source_doc_type": "feature_guide", "source_path": "requirements/feature-docs/activity-based-earning.md", "generation_batch": "feature_knowledge_seed_20260511T091258Z", "deep_source_path": "Activity_Based_Earning.md"}, "is_active": true}, {"id": "72d27c47-1e10-569c-814d-08f322ac07cb", "parent_slug": "loyalty", "slug": "checkin", "name": "Check-in", "item_type": "feature", "description": "Check-in is a daily or weekly attendance mechanic that rewards members for returning consistently. A merchant creates a check-in campaign, defines what members earn at each streak milestone, and members tap a button in the app to record attendance. The system tracks consecutive c", "sort_order": 8, "metadata": {"source_doc_type": "feature_guide", "source_path": "requirements/feature-docs/checkin.md", "generation_batch": "feature_knowledge_seed_20260511T091258Z"}, "is_active": true}, {"id": "1583a5ba-2c9a-525b-bbd5-5250a7bcd77b", "parent_slug": "loyalty", "slug": "currency", "name": "Currency", "item_type": "feature", "description": "Currency is the \"earn\" side of the loyalty loop — the mechanism that converts member activity into tangible value they can later spend on rewards. When a member makes a purchase, completes a mission, or refers a friend, the system calculates how much currency to award based on me", "sort_order": 12, "metadata": {"source_doc_type": "feature_guide", "source_path": "requirements/feature-docs/currency.md", "generation_batch": "feature_knowledge_seed_20260511T091258Z", "deep_source_path": "Currency.md"}, "is_active": true}, {"id": "dc83a7e5-af69-54e5-a1c9-6b6ecb623cdc", "parent_slug": "loyalty", "slug": "forms", "name": "Forms", "item_type": "feature", "description": "Forms control what data the platform collects from members — during signup and on their profile page. Two distinct systems work together: default fields for standard profile data (name, email, phone, address) and custom fields for merchant-defined questions (interests, occupation", "sort_order": 13, "metadata": {"source_doc_type": "feature_guide", "source_path": "requirements/feature-docs/forms.md", "generation_batch": "feature_knowledge_seed_20260511T091258Z", "deep_source_path": "Forms.md"}, "is_active": true}, {"id": "1d78fd7a-81e8-586e-b285-01810d8d654a", "parent_slug": "loyalty", "slug": "missions", "name": "Missions", "item_type": "feature", "description": "Missions are goal-based challenges that guide members through specific actions — making purchases, earning points, referring friends, submitting forms — and reward them upon completion. They are the primary gamification mechanic in the loyalty platform, turning routine behavior i", "sort_order": 15, "metadata": {"source_doc_type": "feature_guide", "source_path": "requirements/feature-docs/missions.md", "generation_batch": "feature_knowledge_seed_20260511T091258Z", "deep_source_path": "Mission.md"}, "is_active": true}, {"id": "8a7a215e-8c9d-5d2d-aafd-27f9444dd129", "parent_slug": "loyalty", "slug": "purchase-transactions", "name": "Purchase Transactions", "item_type": "feature", "description": "Purchase transactions are the primary earning trigger in the loyalty ecosystem — every completed purchase can award currency (points/tickets), advance tier progression, and increment mission progress. The system captures both transaction headers and line-item details in a dual-ta", "sort_order": 17, "metadata": {"source_doc_type": "feature_guide", "source_path": "requirements/feature-docs/purchase-transactions.md", "generation_batch": "feature_knowledge_seed_20260511T091258Z", "deep_source_path": "Purchase_Transaction.md"}, "is_active": true}, {"id": "24e2da13-b9c6-5b0b-8a2e-b0cd6240c8cc", "parent_slug": "loyalty", "slug": "referral", "name": "Referral", "item_type": "feature", "description": "Referral is a word-of-mouth acquisition channel. Existing members (inviters) share a personal invite code; new users (invitees) enter that code during signup. Both sides receive rewards — invitees get direct benefits (points, tickets, or reward items), while inviters earn progres", "sort_order": 18, "metadata": {"source_doc_type": "feature_guide", "source_path": "requirements/feature-docs/referral.md", "generation_batch": "feature_knowledge_seed_20260511T091258Z", "deep_source_path": "Referral.md"}, "is_active": true}, {"id": "146a3373-688e-5826-b409-a6abede83b4e", "parent_slug": "loyalty", "slug": "reward-groups", "name": "Reward Groups & Max Distinct Reward", "item_type": "feature", "description": "Reward Groups let merchants bundle multiple rewards together and control how members pick from that bundle — not just how many units they can take, but how many types they can choose. A member walking up to a \"Zone Tickets\" group with six seat categories shouldn''t be able to clai", "sort_order": 19, "metadata": {"source_doc_type": "feature_guide", "source_path": "requirements/feature-docs/reward-groups.md", "generation_batch": "feature_knowledge_seed_20260511T091258Z"}, "is_active": true}, {"id": "d24bccdb-fef5-5317-8834-9b38012e1a51", "parent_slug": "loyalty", "slug": "rewards", "name": "Rewards", "item_type": "feature", "description": "Rewards are redeemable items in the loyalty marketplace — the primary way members spend the points they''ve earned. A merchant creates rewards (vouchers, physical products, digital codes, experiences) and assigns a points cost. Members browse the catalog, pick a reward, and exchan", "sort_order": 21, "metadata": {"source_doc_type": "feature_guide", "source_path": "requirements/feature-docs/rewards.md", "generation_batch": "feature_knowledge_seed_20260511T091258Z", "deep_source_path": "Reward.md"}, "is_active": true}, {"id": "e22cac9b-71d9-5155-b44a-b843373059bb", "parent_slug": "loyalty", "slug": "store-classification", "name": "Store & Partner Classification", "item_type": "feature", "description": "Store & Partner Classification is how merchants organize their store network into structured groups that drive business rules across the platform. Instead of treating every store identically, merchants define classification dimensions — like sales channel, location, or business t", "sort_order": 22, "metadata": {"source_doc_type": "feature_guide", "source_path": "requirements/feature-docs/store-classification.md", "generation_batch": "feature_knowledge_seed_20260511T091258Z", "deep_source_path": "Store_Attribute_Classification.md"}, "is_active": true}, {"id": "5bd871f5-bedc-52db-94a7-7bc9d64743bd", "parent_slug": "loyalty", "slug": "stored-value-cards", "name": "Stored Value Cards", "item_type": "feature", "description": "Stored Value Cards are prepaid monetary cards that merchants issue to members. Unlike points (which are earned through activities), stored value cards carry a cash-equivalent balance loaded at creation time. A merchant defines card types (e.g., \"Gift Card ฿500\", \"VIP Prepaid ฿2,0", "sort_order": 23, "metadata": {"source_doc_type": "feature_guide", "source_path": "requirements/feature-docs/stored-value-cards.md", "generation_batch": "feature_knowledge_seed_20260511T091258Z"}, "is_active": true}, {"id": "a3bc73b5-87b6-571a-9529-05a4fdc7ba66", "parent_slug": "loyalty", "slug": "tags-and-personas", "name": "Tags & Personas", "item_type": "feature", "description": "Tags and personas are two complementary classification systems that let merchants segment their customer base beyond tiers. Personas represent a member''s business profile — Corporate, Student, Distributor — and each member can have at most one. Tags are behavioral markers — VIP,", "sort_order": 24, "metadata": {"source_doc_type": "feature_guide", "source_path": "requirements/feature-docs/tags-and-personas.md", "generation_batch": "feature_knowledge_seed_20260511T091258Z", "deep_source_path": "Tag_and_Persona.md"}, "is_active": true}, {"id": "9cfbf385-fab6-512b-b66b-5231bdbd173e", "parent_slug": "loyalty", "slug": "tiers", "name": "Tiers", "item_type": "feature", "description": "Tiers rank members into levels based on their activity — purchases, points earned, or order count. A merchant defines a ladder of tiers (e.g., 